    "v2_flexible_TawhVX": {
      "type": "v2_flexible",
      "blocks": {
        "headline_AU8XkH": {
          "type": "headline",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<p>Why Choose a Career as a Gym Instructor?</p><p></p>",
            "heading_align": "left",
            "heading_width": "full",
            "heading_type": "h3",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_no_decal": false,
            "heading_decal_left": true,
            "heading_strong_accented": false
          }
        },
        "subheadline_pwBQpL": {
          "type": "subheadline",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Becoming a <a href=\"/products/cimspa-level-2-certificate-in-fitness-instruction\" title=\"CIMSPA Endorsed Level 2 Certificate in Fitness Instruction\"><strong>gym instructor</strong></a><strong> </strong>is a rewarding career choice for people who are passionate about fitness, health, and helping others achieve their goals. The fitness industry offers strong career prospects, flexible working environments, and opportunities for long-term progression.</p>",
            "text_align": "left",
            "text_width": "full",
            "text_size": "copy-l",
            "text_no_decal": false,
            "text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 16,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "textcol_e4EdeH": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p></p><p><strong>High Demand for Fitness Professionals</strong><br/><br/>The UK health and fitness industry continues to grow(with <a href=\"https://www.ukactive.com/news/uk-health-and-fitness-market-report-reveals-exponential-growth-as-penetration-rate-hits-16-9-and-revenue-grows-8-8/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">annual revenue exceeding £5.7bn</span></a>) as more people prioritise physical health, mental wellbeing, and active lifestyles. Gyms, leisure centres, and health clubs regularly recruit qualified gym instructors and fitness instructors<strong> </strong>to support their members.<br/></p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-l",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": false,
            "right_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Entry-Level Pathway into the Fitness Industry</strong></p><p></p><p>Becoming a gym instructor is one of the most accessible ways to start a career in fitness. You don’t need previous industry experience - only a recognised qualification such as a <a href=\"/products/cimspa-level-2-certificate-in-fitness-instruction\" title=\"CIMSPA Endorsed Level 2 Certificate in Fitness Instruction\">Level 2 Certificate in Fitness Instruction. </a></p><p>This qualification allows you to work in gyms while building experience and progressing your career. <br/></p>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-l",
            "right_text_no_decal": false,
            "right_text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "textcol_A4w7Fw": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Flexible Working Environment</strong></p><p><br/>Many roles also offer flexible hours, making it a great option for people seeking varied schedules. </p><p>Qualified gym instructors can work in a variety of environments, including: </p><ul><li>Commercial gyms </li><li>Leisure centres </li><li>Boutique fitness studios </li><li>Health clubs </li><li>Corporate wellness facilities </li></ul><p><br/></p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-l",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": false,
            "right_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Career Progression Opportunities</strong></p><p><br/>A Level 2 Gym Instructor qualification is often the first step in a long-term fitness career. Many instructors go on to progress into: </p><ul><li><a href=\"/products/cimspa-endorsed-level-3-diploma-practitioner-in-personal-training\" title=\"CIMSPA Endorsed Level 3 Diploma Practitioner in Personal Training\">Level 3 Personal Training qualifications </a></li><li><a href=\"https://studyactive.co.uk/products/l2-gym-instruction-l3-personal-training-l4-nutrition\" title=\"https://studyactive.co.uk/products/l2-gym-instruction-l3-personal-training-l4-nutrition\">Level 4 specialist fitness courses</a></li><li>Gym management or leadership roles </li><li>Strength and conditioning coaching <br/></li></ul>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-l",
            "right_text_no_decal": false,
            "right_text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "textcol_g9g9zN": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Make a Positive Impact</strong></p><p><br/>One of the most rewarding aspects of becoming a gym instructor is helping people improve their health, fitness, and confidence. From supporting beginners to encouraging long-term members, gym instructors play an important role in creating positive lifestyle change.<br/></p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-l",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": false,
            "right_text": "<p><br/></p>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-l",
            "right_text_no_decal": false,
            "right_text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
